  "description": "A fully-fledged C# dialect of SQL — fluent, type-safe SELECT and DML (INSERT, UPDATE, DELETE) for .NET 6+. Covers every ANSI SQL clause plus SQL Server and MariaDB/MySQL dialect extensions. Produces parameterized SQL strings you execute with Dapper, ADO.NET, or any micro-ORM. Zero boilerplate, injection-safe, 151 tests.",
